Z||000000||FieroJoe||05-31-2001||11:13 PM||||Wow, what a weird feeling!!  My friend wanted to drive my Fiero, so I let him (only for a few miles), and I have to say, that riding shotgun felt so incredibly awkward!  I have never ever ridden on that side before.  The only time that I have ever been in my Fiero when it was moving was while I was driving.  Sure is comfortable over there though...<P>But still, I'm tellin ya, if you have only driven your Fiero, have someone you trust drive it while you ride shotgun.  It felt abnormal!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
